# Isolated arcade demo — not a production policy recommendation.
default pass
fragments drop
set cheaters 10.13.37.0/24 2001:db8:bad::/48
drop src @cheaters log
jail 120 proto udp dport 6000-6099 log
limit 3/s burst 3 proto icmp icmp-type 8 log
drop proto tcp dport 23 log
limit 500/s burst 1000 proto udp dport 7777 log
limit 3/s burst 3 proto icmp6 icmp-type 128 log
